    "biography": "<table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Concept</th><td>Six operators</td></tr><tr><th>Number</th><td>6</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Ex-military and former federal agents. Hired as a “special counterterrorism unit.” They think they know what they&#39;re hunting. Most of them have never seen it.</p>\n<p><strong>Gear:</strong> short carbine with incendiary ammunition (aggravated against Kindred), weapon-mounted UV flashlight, light body armor (armor 3), body camera, radio, thermal goggles (negate Obfuscate levels 1 and 2).</p>\n<p><strong>Tactics:</strong> they never go in alone. Always in pairs, always with a drone overhead and a light source behind them. If they lose two operators, they pull back and wait for dawn.</p>",
